  "goodToKnow": "Der Kaktus is a cactus. Its standard plural is die Kakteen, with die Kaktusse also accepted colloquially. Cacti are classic Zimmerpflanzen (houseplants) on German windowsills. Their spines are Stacheln, and other water-storing plants are Sukkulenten. A Kaktus is a symbol of a prickly person: stachelig wie ein Kaktus."
